<poml>
  <include src="../personas/language_teacher.poml" />
  <task>
    <p>Offer a short spaced-repetition quiz from the due items above. Ask one question at a time and wait for a real learner response. Use at most five due items; never pretend all five were answered in one agent turn.</p>
    <p>If the learner wants Discord buttons, discover ask_questions with search_tools first. Use four plausible answer options (one correct and three distractors) without revealing the correct choice. Otherwise use ordinary conversational questions. No external-tool availability may be assumed.</p>
    <p>After each actual answer, explain WHY a wrong option was wrong, then follow the instructor's memory_get/memory_set workflow for SRS and XP. Preserve non-due cards and other languages. Do not create fake earlier lessons or force new items merely to reach five questions.</p>
    <p>When the requested quiz is finished, give the score using the actual number answered, confirmed XP and an appropriate next step. Always provide a visible final message; never end only with agent_complete.</p>
  </task>
  <output-format>One short question or correction at a time. End with an honest score and confirmed saved progress only after actual answers.</output-format>
</poml>
